<!-- ll-avatar demo — mirrors the upstream docs page (#/components/avatar).
     The demo portraits are pre-rasterized PNGs (packages/example/assets/) —
     WeChat <image> cannot render SVG data URIs like the upstream docs. -->
<view class="demo">
  <view class="demo-title">Avatar</view>
  <view class="sec-desc">A face, circled in felt tip. The picture is circled by a hand-drawn loop; without one the initials sit on a disc of marker in a stationery color chosen from the name. A status dot goes on the corner, and a group overlaps its faces and ends in a sketched "+3".</view>

  <view class="sec">
    <view class="sec-h2">Preview</view>
    <view class="sub-h3">Photo and initials</view>
    <view class="sec-desc">A picture circled by hand, and what shows while there is none: initials on a disc of marker whose color is chosen from the name. The four sizes are `sm`, `default`, `lg` and `xl`; `AvatarBadge` puts a status dot on the corner.</view>
    <view class="row row--items-end">
      <ll-avatar size="sm" seed="a1">
        <ll-avatar-image src="/assets/portrait-warm.png" alt="Ada Lovelace" />
        <ll-avatar-fallback name="Ada Lovelace" />
      </ll-avatar>
      <ll-avatar seed="a2">
        <ll-avatar-image src="/assets/portrait-sky.png" alt="Jo Okafor" />
        <ll-avatar-fallback name="Jo Okafor" />
        <ll-avatar-badge status="online" aria-label="online" />
      </ll-avatar>
      <ll-avatar size="lg" seed="a3">
        <ll-avatar-image src="/missing-portrait.png" alt="" />
        <ll-avatar-fallback name="Mika Kobayashi" />
        <ll-avatar-badge status="away" aria-label="away" />
      </ll-avatar>
      <ll-avatar size="xl" seed="a4">
        <ll-avatar-fallback name="Sam Reyes" />
        <ll-avatar-badge status="busy" aria-label="busy" />
      </ll-avatar>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="sec">
    <view class="sec-h2">Examples</view>

    <view class="sub-h3">Color from the name</view>
    <view class="sec-desc">Give `AvatarFallback` a `name` and it makes the initials, picks one of eight stationery colors from the name (the same person is the same color everywhere) and lets a screen reader hear the full name instead of two letters. `ring` picks the pen of the loop, and `"none"` draws no loop for long lists.</view>
    <view class="stack">
      <view class="row row--wrap">
        <ll-avatar wx:for="{{people}}" wx:key="*this" size="lg" seed="p-{{item}}">
          <ll-avatar-fallback name="{{item}}" />
        </ll-avatar>
      </view>
      <view class="row row--gap5">
        <ll-avatar size="lg" ring="you" seed="ring-you">
          <ll-avatar-fallback name="Ada Lovelace" />
          <ll-avatar-badge status="online" aria-label="online" />
        </ll-avatar>
        <ll-avatar size="lg" ring="marker" seed="ring-marker">
          <ll-avatar-fallback name="Ada Lovelace" />
        </ll-avatar>
        <ll-avatar size="lg" ring="none" seed="ring-none">
          <ll-avatar-fallback name="Ada Lovelace" />
        </ll-avatar>
        <text class="note">ring: you, marker, none</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="sub-h3">Groups</view>
    <view class="sec-desc">`AvatarGroup` overlaps faces and a paper-colored ring cuts each one out of the last (`--ll-avatar-ring` changes the color on a different surface). `AvatarGroupCount` is the sketched disc for everyone who did not fit; it takes text or an icon (the icon is a placeholder until ll-icon lands in M2).</view>
    <view class="stack">
      <ll-avatar-group seed-hint="g1">
        <ll-avatar seed="g1-1">
          <ll-avatar-image src="/assets/portrait-warm.png" alt="Ada Lovelace" />
          <ll-avatar-fallback name="Ada Lovelace" />
        </ll-avatar>
        <ll-avatar seed="g1-2">
          <ll-avatar-fallback name="Jo Okafor" />
        </ll-avatar>
        <ll-avatar seed="g1-3">
          <ll-avatar-image src="/assets/portrait-sky.png" alt="Mika Kobayashi" />
          <ll-avatar-fallback name="Mika Kobayashi" />
        </ll-avatar>
        <ll-avatar seed="g1-4">
          <ll-avatar-fallback name="Sam Reyes" />
        </ll-avatar>
        <ll-avatar-group-count>+3</ll-avatar-group-count>
      </ll-avatar-group>
      <ll-avatar-group size="lg">
        <ll-avatar wx:for="{{group2}}" wx:key="*this" size="lg" seed="g2-{{item}}">
          <ll-avatar-fallback name="{{item}}" />
        </ll-avatar>
        <ll-avatar-group-count size="lg">+</ll-avatar-group-count>
      </ll-avatar-group>
      <ll-avatar-group size="sm">
        <ll-avatar wx:for="{{group3}}" wx:key="*this" size="sm" seed="g3-{{item}}">
          <ll-avatar-fallback name="{{item}}" />
        </ll-avatar>
        <ll-avatar-group-count size="sm">+8</ll-avatar-group-count>
      </ll-avatar-group>
    </view>

    <view class="sub-h3">Team card</view>
    <view class="sec-desc">A people list in a card: face, name, role, and a presence dot. Each face is a separate small drawing (the list is short); a list of hundreds would use `ring="none"`.</view>
    <view class="card-stage">
      <ll-card seed="team" custom-style="width:100%;max-width:768rpx">
        <ll-card-header>
          <ll-card-title>On the team</ll-card-title>
          <ll-card-description>4 people, 2 of them at their desks.</ll-card-description>
          <view slot="action">
            <ll-button size="sm" variant="outline">Invite</ll-button>
          </view>
        </ll-card-header>
        <ll-card-content custom-style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:32rpx">
          <view class="team-row" wx:for="{{team}}" wx:key="name">
            <ll-avatar size="lg" seed="team-{{item.name}}">
              <ll-avatar-fallback name="{{item.name}}" />
              <ll-avatar-badge status="{{item.status}}" aria-label="{{item.status}}" />
            </ll-avatar>
            <view class="team-id">
              <text class="team-name">{{item.name}}</text>
              <text class="team-role">{{item.role}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="team-row team-row--pt">
            <ll-avatar-group size="sm">
              <ll-avatar wx:for="{{watchers}}" wx:key="*this" size="sm" seed="w-{{item}}">
                <ll-avatar-fallback name="{{item}}" />
              </ll-avatar>
              <ll-avatar-group-count size="sm">+5</ll-avatar-group-count>
            </ll-avatar-group>
            <text class="team-role">also watching</text>
          </view>
        </ll-card-content>
      </ll-card>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
